OL,3,GNEWSAWoman aged in her 80s dies in
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman aged in her 80s has died in
OL,7,Fhospital after being struck by a
OL,8,Fvehicle last week in County Down.
OL,10,FPolice said they received a report at
OL,11,Fabout 17:30 GMT on Thursday evening of
OL,12,Fa collision involving a female
OL,13,Fpedestrian and a white Mercedes in the
OL,14,FCircular Road area of Newtownards.
OL,16,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,17,F(PSNI) said officers attended the
OL,18,Fscene, along with colleagues from the
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland Ambulance Service
OL,20,F(NIAS), and the woman was taken to
OL,21,Fhospital for treatment for serious
OL,22,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
