OL,3,GNEWSAWoman aged in her 80s dies in
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on Tuesday, the PSNI
OL,7,Fsaid the woman had since "sadly passed
OL,8,Faway as a result of those injuries".
